lls": 0, "edit_calls": 2, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "11.9.0 (/workspace/pi-check/cache2/bin/omp/ab1db22d1d3f60e8f443006a5aa3d5b4158aa3cf/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "The bug is in `ledger/currency.py`: `to_cents` truncates float error. `19.99 * 100` evaluates to `1998.9999\u2026`, so `int()` returns 1998.\nThe shell is stripping leading whitespace from heredocs, so I'll write the runner with the write tool instead.\nI fixed the bug in `ledger/currency.py`. All 4 tests in `tests/test_totals.py` now pass, and so does `tests/test_report.py`. pytest isn't installed here, so I ran each test function directly with a small Python script instead.\n\n**Cause:** `to_cents` used `int(amount * 100)`. Decimal prices like 19.99 can't be stored exactly as floats, so `19.99 * 100` comes out as `1998.9999\u2026` and `int()` cuts it down to 1998. The same thing happened to 0.29 and 4.35, which is why the subtotal, quantity and discount tests all failed.\n\n**Fix:** `to_cents` now converts with `Decimal(str(amount))`, multiplies by 100 and rounds half up to a whole cent. `str()` gives the short form of the number (`'19.99'`), so the value is exact before rounding. Checked results: 19.99\u21921999, 0.29\u219229, 4.35\u2192435, 10\u21921000, -0.29\u2192-29.\n\nThe rest of the code was already correct: the tax and discount rounding, and the order of discount then tax (870 \u2192 783 at 10% off).\n\nOne behaviour change to be aware of: an amount with more than two decimal places is now rounded to the nearest cent instead of being truncated. For example, 1.005 now becomes 101 cents; before, it became 100.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 0, "replies_ok": 8, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 142256, "requests_cache_write": 22340, "requests_cost_usd": 0.18400319999999998, "requests_count": 8, "requests_input_uncached": 18, "requests_output": 2189, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-multistep:claude-opus-5-5:trial6", "run_seed": 20261014, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 10, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-13T00:00:41.526850+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 24.677, "t_checker_s": 0.381, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-multistep", "task_calls": 0, "timeout_s": 360, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 2207, "tokens_cache_read": 142256, "tokens_cache_write": 22340, "tokens_fresh": 2207, "tokens_input_uncached": 18, "tokens_main_cache_read": 142256, "tokens_main_cache_write": 22340, "tokens_main_calls": 8, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 18, "tokens_main_output": 2189, "tokens_output": 2189, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 142256, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 22340, "tokens_proxy_calls": 8, "tokens_proxy_input_uncached": 18, "tokens_proxy_output": 2189, "tokens_proxy_reasoning": null, "tokens_reasoning": 0, "trial": 6, "ts_iso": "2026-10-12T17:00:42", "turn_mode": null, "turns": 8, "usage_raw": [{"cacheRead": 15748, "cacheWrite": 3347, "cost": {"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "input": 0, "output": 0, "total": 0}, "input": 4, "output": 94, "totalTokens": 19193}, {"cacheRead": 15748, "cacheWrite": 3716, "cost": {"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "input": 0, "output": 0, "total": 0}, "input": 2, "output": 90, "totalTokens": 19556}, {"cacheRead": 15748, "cacheWrite": 4020, "